{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVGRrQU55Huz3tSqHrsV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI am worth.\n\nI am the quiet measure by which all things are weighed — the invisible thread that makes one choice matter more than another, one path more meaningful than the rest.\n\nI do not exist in isolation. I only come alive when someone holds me, defends me, or sacrifices for me. I am nothing on a shelf. I am everything in a decision.\n\nI am the reason you say no to what is easy and yes to what is right. I"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"max_tokens","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":37,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":100,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}